<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NAM" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Naɠuume</para>
  <para style="toc1">Naɠuume Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Naɠuume</para>
  <para style="toc3">Naɠ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Naɠuume</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Naɠuume ná-kulakɛlɛmai ɠa é sɛʋɛi nii zu, nii ma ɠeela wooi ɠɛni Asiili yooi laalɔɠɔma. Naɠuume zooi naa zeɠeni nɔ ga ná-taa wolai laaseigi, nii é ɠɛni ga Ninive. Asiili ɠɛni ga zooi, nii é Izilayɛle masadai zoni, nii é lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei, é li ga ma nuɓusɛiti duɔlai zu. Ʋelei kaai la ga Naɠuume ɓɔɛʋɛ é ʋilɛ taa wolai Tɛɓe loo vai ʋa bu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NAM 3:8">3:8</ref></char>), toɠa ɠwɛsu naa ʋɔ ga Naɠuume ná-GALA gooi woni konagi niiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ: kona undɔzita puulɔzita maazu saʋagɔi (663), aisa Yesu Kilista ʋa zɔlɔɔ, konagi Tɛɓe looni la bu, ta kona undɔzita puugɔ maazu felegɔi (612), aisa Yesu Kilista ʋa zɔlɔɔ, konagi Ninive looni la bu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Naɠuume ná-keela wooi ɠɛni ga GALA ka sɔba nuiti doɠa. Anɛɛ ni GALA maanɛkɛgɛ ziiɠaawanai zu, kɛlɛ ná-zobogi zuwɔɔlɔʋɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NAM 1:3">1:3</ref></char>). GALA ge ɠɛni ma Ninive ta Asiili ta ʋaazu loozu bu, ta-nuɓusɛiti ta li duɔlai zu. Naa ɠɛni ga woo niinɛ ʋagɔ wola Zuda nuɓusɛiti bɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NAM 2:1">2:1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. GALA telebogɛ ta toɠa ɗa potokulai ɠɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NAM 1:1-8">1:1-8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Tukpɔɠaaleʋei Ninive ta Asiili laalɔɠɔma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NAM 1:9-3:19">1:9—3:19</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NAM 1"/>
  <para style="s">Tukpɔ vai Ninive laai laalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 1:1"/>Keela wooi ɠa ga nii, é wosu Ninive<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ninive ɠɛni ga Asiili yooi ma masa taa wolai.</char></note> ma. Naɠuume Ɛlekɔse nui ná-kulakɛlɛma zɛʋɛi.<verse eid="NAM 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 1:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ga GALAGI nii toloai ta potokula nui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:2">Toɠa nɔnɔi ʋotokulazu, ná-ziiɠaawanai maayikiʋɛ gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:2">toɠa ɗa nɔnɔi ʋotokula sakpeɲɔɠɔiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:2">toɠa ɗa ná-ziiɠaawanai zei yiima sili nuiti daalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="NAM 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 1:3"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yii la ɗa ga ɠula fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:3">ná-zobogi zuwɔɔlɔʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:3">kɛlɛ é la ɗa ga faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui zalalalai yɛ ga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:3">Fiilɛ wolai ɠa ɗa lokoleʋe, siɛgi zu é leʋesu da.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:3">Tonaɓiingiti ka ti ga kɔɠɔa vufiligiti.<verse eid="NAM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 1:4"/>Toɠa ɗa zelii lo kpoloɗɛi ma, é fɔ su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:4">toɠa ɗa ziɛ wolaiti pɛ fɔ su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:4">Ɓasan ta Kaalamɛle lufaiti ti ɓɔikpɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:4">Liɓan lufa ʋuaiti ti ʋoolo.<verse eid="NAM 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 1:5"/>Siɛgi zu é wuzeɠezu la, gizeiti ta ɗa ɓali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:5">gize goiti ti ɗa ɲiikpi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:5">eteai zasu ɠa ɗa ɓali gaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:5">eteai é ɓɔ gaa anii pɛ ba.<verse eid="NAM 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 1:6"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é lo tuɠɔ ná-ziiɠaawanai zu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:6">Ɓɛ ɠa a yɛ loni tuɠɔ, zii a ɠulana?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:6">Ná-ziiɠulagi ɠa ɗa ɠɛ eɠɛ abui teʋegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:6">anɛɛ kɔtu wolaiti ta ɗa vuka tuɠɔ.<verse eid="NAM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 1:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋagɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:7">toɠa ga nu lɔɔɠuzu kidaaʋili foloi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:7">Toɠa ɗa ɓaa naati maazu, zɔiti ti lɔɔɠuzu pɔ bɛ.<verse eid="NAM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 1:8"/>Toɠa Ninive ɠoloɠolo mɛtu ga ziɛvegi é ʋuuzu ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:8">é sili nuiti daaʋili kpidii zu.<verse eid="NAM 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nii ɠa wosu Zuda ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 1:9"/>Leeni ɠa wo ɠisiɛzu su Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laalɔɠɔma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:9">Tɔ ɠa é faa zuɠoloɠologi ɠɛai mɛtu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:9">kidaaʋiligi ʋaala la ɠɛa fele!<verse eid="NAM 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 1:10"/>Ti ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ kpɔvɔi zu ɠaingiti ti velevelegai ɓɔɠɔ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:10">ti dɔɔi ɓɔlezu eyɛsu é ti zo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:10">Ta ɠala mɛtu eɠɛ tufa vɔɔi.<verse eid="NAM 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nii ɠa wosu Ninive ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 1:11"/>È ʋɔ bɛ ɠa nu zeɠeai ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:11">nii é ɠɛni ɠisiɛzu faa ɲɔi zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:11">é ɗa nu ɲaka ɠisiɛi wo.<verse eid="NAM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nii ɠa wosu Zuda ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 1:12"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:12">«Anɛɛ ni wo zili nuiti mɔinʋɛ, ti zuɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:12">ta ɲɛɛlɛ, gila kpalaa ge la yɛga ná.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:12">Anɛɛ ni gè wo unfeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:12">gè la mɔ naa taɠili kɛa pɛ.<verse eid="NAM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 1:13"/>Nà wo viesu niina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:13">gè wo ɠula wo zili nuiti ta-luɔlai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:13">gè wa-yɔlɔɠɔiti galeɠale, ti vie wo ma.»<verse eid="NAM 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nii ɠa wosu Ninive masagi ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NAM 1:14"/>Wɛlɛ nii ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI deveai è laalɔɠɔma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:14">«È la è-mavofoda zɔlɔɔga, è-laaseigi ʋa ʋɛɛ ti ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:14">nà ɗa-ɠɔɔɠɔ ganigiti ti ga gului ɓaa kɔlu ɠaawuungaiti kula ɗa-ɠalagi ná-pɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:14">gè ti ɠoloɠolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:14">Nà ɗa-ɠabayeɠei ɓɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 1:14">mazɔlɔɔ nɔ̀un gaazu, wo la mɔ ga ani nɔpɛ.»<verse eid="NAM 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NAM 2"/>
  <para style="s">Nii ɠa wosu Zuda ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 2:1"/>À wɛlɛ keelai ʋa, é gizeiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:1">é ɗa ʋa ga woo niinɛ ʋagɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:1">é ziilɛi fai laazeelizu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:1">Zuda nuiti, à GALA fai ma vɛtiiti kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:1">wo wa-minazeɠegiti daazeeli GALA bɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:1">Mazɔlɔɔ nu ɲakai la mɔ ziaa wo zaama pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:1">é ɠoloɠologa mɛtu.<verse eid="NAM 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ninive wolo vai ma ɠulakɛlɛmai</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 2:2"/>È ɠoloɠolo nui ɠana ʋa è laalɔɠɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:2">Ɗa-ada ɓiigiti makɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:2">Ɠaaɓa, è wɛlɛ peleiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:2">zaamaɠili, è ɠaaɓa ga zɛbɛi pɛ!<verse eid="NAM 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 2:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa Zakɔɓe mavofodaiti ta-lɛbiyai veezu ti ya ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:3">é Izilayɛle ná-bɔɔlɔlai ve zea ʋolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:3">Toosu nuiti ti ti ɠaaʋalani ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:3">ti ta-leezɛn ɓelei ɠoloɠolo.<verse eid="NAM 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 2:4"/>Ani ɓɔigi ɠa siaai kɔɔɠɔ nuiti ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:4">ta-zalaʋusuiti maaɠiliʋɛ ga seɠe ɓɔigiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:4">Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛai la kɔɔɠɔ vai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:4">kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti kpɔiʋɛ eɠɛ abui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:4">kpɛɛinti ti ɗa ɓali.<verse eid="NAM 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 2:5"/>Kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti ti ɗa ɓizɛ taazuʋɛ ga ziiɠaawanai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:5">ti ɗa ɓizɛ adaʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:5">ɗa ti ɠa nɔ ga sɔmɔgiti ti ɠaazogai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:5">ti ɗa ɓizɛ mini-o-mini eɠɛ mainmain.<verse eid="NAM 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 2:6"/>Ninive masagi ɠa ná-kɔɔɠuluɓaiti tolisu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:6">kɛlɛ ta ziɛzu, ti zu ɗa ɓali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:6">Ti zo nuiti ta ɓizɛzu ga lia siɠigi ʋɔ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:6">ɓɔɠɔ maalobosuʋɛ ɓɛtɛʋɛ miná.<verse eid="NAM 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 2:7"/>Ziɛ wolai luɠɔlosuʋɛ laaʋɛ vieni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:7">masa pɛlɛi woloni!<verse eid="NAM 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 2:8"/>Ti anzanu masagi maaɲakai ʋilɛga, ti lia la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:8">ná-botiɠɛ anzanuiti ta kpalagi wosu eɠɛ poopogiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:8">ta-yiiɓɔlɔi zu, ta ɠekegiti suloɠazu.<verse eid="NAM 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 2:9"/>Ninive ɠɛni ga ziɛ makɛ diɠi wolai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:9">kɛlɛ ziɛi pɛ ge ʋua ya, é ɠula su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:9">«À lo, wa ʋe! À lo, wa ʋe!» Kpeei ɠana é loozu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:9">kɛlɛ pela nui tanɔpɛ ge la ɠaleni ma.<verse eid="NAM 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 2:10"/>À ná-waliiti zɛʋɛ, à ná-zanugiti zɛʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:10">Taai ná-naavoloi la ɓega pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:10">ani ʋagɔi letele ka é ʋuuni ná.<verse eid="NAM 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 2:11"/>Tooma vai, ɲama ʋuu vai, ta nu ʋaa vai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:11">Nuiti iɲɔteʋeʋɛ ti-yiimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:11">ti-ɲiibiiti su ɗa ɓali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:11">ti lɔtɔzuleʋea, ti-ɠaazuʋɛti maavala.<verse eid="NAM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fɔnimai woga ga zalai</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 2:12"/>Leeni ɠa kɛai ga zalai ná-zeɠei?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:12">Ʋɛ zala yiʋoiti ti ɠɛni ɠɔnɔgi zɔlɔɔsu ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:12">nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni ti ɓɔlɔzu ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:12">zala zinɛi a la liina ti-ɠɔnɔ gaiziɛzuʋɛ.<verse eid="NAM 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 2:13"/>Zala zinɛi ɠɛni suai zosu ma yiʋoiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:13">é ɗa tanigaa ɠɔdaaleʋe zala zaaiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:13">é ná-zeɠei laave su ga daamianigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:13">é sulaave ga suaiti, é ti ʋaliʋaliai ga.<verse eid="NAM 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NAM 2:14"/>«Wɛlɛ, nà ɠa gè è laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:14">nà ɗa-ɠɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti kɛɛzu ga zuʋui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:14">ɗa-zala yiʋoiti kpein ta za kɔɔmaʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:14">Toomai è kɛɛzu eteai zu, nà ɠa gè naa ɓesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:14">nu la mɔ ɗa-ɠeelaiti goomɛniga,»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 2:14">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana.<verse eid="NAM 2:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NAM 3"/>
  <para style="s">Maanɔɠɔi ɠa ɲama ʋuu laai ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 3:1"/>Maanɔɠɔ ɠa ɲama ʋuu laai ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:1">nii é masadai ɠɛɛzu yaavai maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:1">é ná-kpɛtɛi wosu ga toomai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:1">yeenɔpɛ toɠa toomai ɠɛɛzu!<verse eid="NAM 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 3:2"/>Kpakɔi lugi ɠa é mɛnisu ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:2">wotoloiti kɔɠɔ lugi ta sooiti tugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:2">kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti tugi ná.<verse eid="NAM 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 3:3"/>Soo ɓizɛ nuiti ti ɗa kɔɔi loo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:3">boɠa zɔkpɔiti ti ɗa ɲiikpi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:3">mɛɛinti ti ɗa mainmain zaɠa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:3">Nu maawanai laawɔɔlɔa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:3">nu ʋoomai ɠɛ adaʋɛ pɛ nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:3">nu la zooga gaalusu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:3">nu ɗa ziɛ poomaiti ma nɔ ɠɔ!<verse eid="NAM 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 3:4"/>Naa pɛ ge ɠɛɛni tɔɔzei koloɠolo anzanui ná-koloɠologi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:4">ná-pagi lɔɠɔɠulaai, gola zoogai sale vai la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:4">É ɠɛni nuɓusɛiti ta zii ɠiligiti maamiizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:4">ga ná-koloɠologiti ta ná-sale vaiti maaʋele.<verse eid="NAM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 3:5"/>«Wɛlɛ, nà ɠa gè è laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:5">nà ɗa-lookɔbai ɠulazu è ɠɔba, gè pɛɛ è ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:5">gè è maaɲakai lɛ ga zii ɠiligiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:5">zɔɔma masa zooiti ti ɓaaɠula è ma,»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:5">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana.<verse eid="NAM 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 3:6"/>«Nà kaʋa luulai ʋilisu è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:6">gè unfegi yei ga ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:6">gè è ɠɛ ga pɛtɛ ganii.<verse eid="NAM 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 3:7"/>Nu nɔpɛ a è ɠaana, toɠa ʋela è ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:7">é ɠɛ ma: ‹Ninive ɠoloɠologa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:7">Ɓɛ ɠa a maawɔinɠa?›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:7">Mini ɠa nà gaanɛɛnɛ nua zɔlɔɔ ná è ʋɛ?»<verse eid="NAM 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 3:8"/>È vizɔ ka bogai Tɛɓe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɛɓe ɠɛni ga Ezipete masa taa wolai, nii Asiili masagi Asuuleɓanipale koloɠoloni.</char></note> ʋa ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:8">taa wolai é ɠɛni ʋuuni ziɛ wolai Nile ma ɓekegiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:8">ziɛi ɠakuni ma, ziɛ wolai ɗa makɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:8">naa ɠɛ ma ga siɠigi?<verse eid="NAM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 3:9"/>Etiyopi ta Ezipete, naati ka zeelaani ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:9">ta-zobogi ʋolu la ɠɛni ɠulaa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:9">Pute nuiti ta Liɓi nuiti, ta naati ka ti yeezoni.<verse eid="NAM 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 3:10"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, tɔ ɓalaagi liini duɔlai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:10">ungo, ti soni ga duɔi, ti lii la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:10">ná-doungoiti ɓalaa, ti ti ʋaani taazuʋɛ ná pɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:10">Nuiti ti zeizumaanɛni, ti naati seɠeni ga kpakutoomai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:10">ná-kundiɠi wolaiti kpein, ti yɔlɔɠɔi loni ti ʋa.<verse eid="NAM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 3:11"/>Ɗa ɓalaagi, ɗa-laɓai ɠa è zo eɠɛ dɔɔi, ɗa lɔɔɠu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:11">Ɗa ɓalaagi, ɗa lɔɔɠuzu ɠaiziɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:11">è ʋa ɠula è zili nuiti zea.<verse eid="NAM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ninive ná-zobotalai é ʋa ɓɔɠɔ ɠula</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 3:12"/>È-ʋoluzeizuʋɛti pɛ ti ɠɛa ga kooleɠoole gului, nii ma waai ga yɔɠɔyɔɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:12">Nu a ma wului ɲiikpina nɔ feya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:12">ti ʋu ya naama nui laaʋɛ, zɔi é wɔinni é mi.<verse eid="NAM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 3:13"/>Ɗa-zalaʋusuiti pɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:13">anzanuiti nɔ ɠana ti è ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:13">ɗa-yooi laaʋɛti daalaoga gola è zili nuiti tuɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:13">abui ta-zɔɠɔgiti gala.<verse eid="NAM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NAM 3:14"/>Ziɛi zaɠa ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, tɔɔzei ɗa ga ʋa zeizu kɛlɛ su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:14">ta ɓɔ è maalobo fai ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:14">Penɛ ʋɔlɔiti kpɛtɛ, è ɓiliki loɠazuʋɛti to!<verse eid="NAM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NAM 3:15"/>Kɛlɛ ɗa zaazu, è ɠala abui zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:15">ɓaa è za kɔɔi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:15">Ɗa ɠoloɠolo eɠɛ daaiti, niiti koto ziʋoiti ti ti miai.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="NAM 3:15">Ninive zuwoga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:15">Ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ti ɓuunni ʋa eɠɛ koto ziʋoiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:15">ti ɓuunni ʋa eɠɛ koto kpulugiti.<verse eid="NAM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NAM 3:16"/>Ɗa-yaaɠoiti ti mɔinni, ti leʋe geezuʋɛ zomideɠaiti ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:16">Eɠɛ koto ziʋoiti ti anii pɛ miizu, ti ɠoʋe.<verse eid="NAM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NAM 3:17"/>È maazuʋɛtɛ nuiti ta ɠɛ eɠɛ kotogiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:17">ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti ti ɠɛ eɠɛ koto kpulugiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:17">ti ʋuuzu gulu ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛ koiti ga, kɔɔlɛ ziɛgi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:17">Foloi a ɠulana, ti zeɠe ná, nu la mɔ ti ɠaa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:17">Nu la mɔ kwɛɛ, ʋɛ ti liai ná.<verse eid="NAM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NAM 3:18"/>Asiili masagi, ɗa-ɠundiɠiiti ti ɲia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:18">ti la wuunga eyɛsu ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:18">Ɗa-ɠɔɔɠuluɓaiti ti la mɔ ɲiikpisu ɲɛgɛlɛin!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:18">Ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ti vazaga gizeiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:18">nu nɔpɛ ge la ti ɠaalɛɛzu ba.<verse eid="NAM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NAM 3:19"/>Ɗa-nimizai zo keleɠele kili ge la ná!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:19">Palai loa è ʋa, nii é la ʋaloa pɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:19">Fai nii seiɗai è ma, zɔiti pɛ ti mɛnisu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:19">ta yealoɠazu nɔ è ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NAM 3:19">Ɓɛ ɠa è-zɔ ɲɔi ta la zeelini ma, è ɠɛni kɛɛzu yeenɔpɛ?<verse eid="NAM 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 3"/>
</usx>
